+# overflow. An entry 2^k (X βs)ᵢ that is representable meets Yᵢ in its own units, so that a small Yᵢ
+# survives a product that cancels; the others are formed as (X βs)ᵢ - Yᵢ 2^-k in units of 2^k. The two
+# sums of squares are added by their exponents. This allocates a copy of β and two arrays of the size
